AuthKey_*
private_keys/

# Agent git worktrees, checked out inside the repo by the Claude Code
# runtime. Each is a full checkout of this repo -- node_modules and
# mobile/ios asset catalogs included -- so committing one by accident
# (a stray `git add -A`) would be a very large mistake. The runtime also
# writes this path to .git/info/exclude, but that file is local to one
# clone and never committed, so a fresh clone elsewhere has no such
# protection. Only worktrees/ is ignored -- .claude/launch.json is
# tracked deliberately.
# nuxt.config.ts excludes the same path from Nuxt's and Vite's file
# watchers, for a different reason (EMFILE) with the same root cause.
.claude/worktrees/
